                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Near the top of the range</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Near the middle of the range</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            None of this means you need a different ball for every session, but it does explain why the same group can feel like it is playing a different game from one court to the next. If your group alternates between indoor and outdoor play, keep one approved ball of each type and stick with them, rather than switching brands every week.
          </p>
        </div>

